  questionText:
  - language: English
    text: Which pair of enantiomers is perceived as different smells, even though
      both possess the same molecular formula?
  - language: German
    text: "Welches Enantiomerenpaar zeigt unterschiedliche Ger\xFCche, obwohl beide
      Molek\xFCle chemisch gleich aufgebaut sind?"
  answers:
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: D-Glucose and L-Glucose
    - language: German
      text: D-Glukose und L-Glukose
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: "(+)-Carvone and (\u2013)-Carvone"
    - language: German
      text: "(+)-Carvon und (\u2013)-Carvon"
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Glycine and Alanine
    - language: German
      text: Glycin und Alanin
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: D-Alanine and L-Alanine
    - language: German
      text: D-Alanin und L-Alanin
  correctAnswer: 2
